sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant W as Web interface
 participant A as Scoring API
 participant M as Model files
 U->>W: Enter applicant details
 W->>A: Submit request
 A->>A: Validate input
 A->>M: Read trained models
 M-->>A: Model data
 A->>A: Score, calibrate and explain
 A-->>W: Risk results
 W-->>U: Display assessment
